sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Asset as Substation PLC / Router
    participant API as FastAPI Ingestion Endpoint
    participant ML as IsolationForest & AutoEncoder
    participant Agent as SOAR Response Agent
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database
    participant SOC as React SOC Cyber Dashboard

    Asset->>API: POST /api/v1/logs (Telemetry Packet)
    API->>ML: Run ML Inference (predict)
    ML-->>API: { is_anomaly: true, score: 0.92, category: "SCADA_Command_Injection" }
    API->>DB: Save Alert & Anomaly Log Record
    API->>Agent: Query SOAR Response Agent (playbook recommendation)
    Agent-->>API: Recommend PLAYBOOK_ISOLATE_SCADA_PLC
    API-->>SOC: Broadcast Real-time Critical Alert Notification
    SOC->>API: POST /api/v1/response (Execute SOAR Playbook)
    API->>Asset: Apply Firewall Isolation Rule (Port 502)
    API->>DB: Update Asset Status to ISOLATED & Record Audit Log
    API-->>SOC: Return Playbook Execution Log (245ms)
